<h1>Rules</h1>
<p>Before using the site, you should read through these rules & our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, both of which may be changed at any time. Using this site indicates you agree with these policies.</p>
<ul>
<li>No attacks towards any individual, group, race, gender, sexual identity, or religion.</li>
<li>No spam allowed.</li>
<li>Posting anyone else's personal information <strong>anywhere on the site</strong> is not allowed. Personal information includes but is not limited to name, physical address, email address and phone number.</li>
<li>Reviews must follow the rating of the story.</li>
<li>By using Fanfiction Online, you acknowledge that you are at least 13 years old and able to consent to the processing of personal data without obtaining written permission from a parent or legal guardian according to the laws of the country (countries) you are a resident/citizen of.</li>
<li>Stories published must follow the <a href="/guidelines">content guidelines</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>We reserve the right to remove any content or suspend/ban any account without prior notice. You may contest such a suspension/ban or removal of content by <a>contacting us</a>.</p>
<p>If you feel these rules are being violated on the site, <a href="/contact">send us a message</a> with a reference to such content and we'll look in to it.</p>
<p>If you have a question, you can check out the <a href="/help/faq">FAQ</a>. If the question has not yet been asked, you can ask it there.</p>
